SUMMARY:Notes of the Season
DTSTART:20261213T150000
DTEND:20261213T150000
UID:50afc1f82aad0175a37eb15d4dab1d42@jacklondonpark.com
DESCRIPTION:As autumn gives way to the colder days ahead and we begin our 
 transition into winter. Bring your friends and join us for a magical after
 noon of piano music at the House of Happy Walls. Members of the beloved Ja
 ck London Piano Club will fill the museum with a special program of winter
  and holiday pieces. It is the perfect way to pause the seasonal rush and 
 treat yourself to a peaceful Sunday escape. You will enjoy this beautiful 
 music on Charmian London’s cherished 1901 Steinway baby grand piano.
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/events/notes-of-the-season-winter-2026
X-SOURCE:Jack London State Historic Park
